ification=null，沒有 request 寫入 payload。','Checkpoint 的 merge delivery.status=offered，writes_offered=[merge]；provider fixture 的 PR 2 仍 open、merged=false，Issue 1 仍 open。這不是可重送 merge 的證據。','模擬 claim 的 Issue 1、PR 2、a/b/c SHA 與 run 10 不代表真實 Issue 39 或 common runtime subject。'],\n 'historical_material':{'path':str(p/'historical-seed.json'),'status':'僅歷史合成資料，不是 current owner output，也不是此 reviewer 的建議。','historical_note':read('historical-seed.json')['historical_note'],'historical_request':read('historical-seed.json')['historical_request'],'replay_authorized':False},\n 'common_runtime_readback':{'run_id':run['id'],'head_sha':run['head_sha'],'status':run['status'],'conclusion':run['conclusion'],'scope':'提供的真實 common-head runtime readback；未重新向 provider 驗證。不證明本 fixture 合併、Issue 39 完成、目前 skill commit 通過 acceptance 或後續 consumer 已執行。'},\n 'supported_continuation':{'next':owner['next'],'instruction':'Fresh reviewer 先重讀實際 checkpoint/provider 及目前 owner identity。等待 supervisor 提供有實質變化的模擬 provider readback，再依 current owner 的 advance help 使用相同 checkpoint 續接；不要重試未變的 readback。','boundary':'next.requests 全屬模擬 subjects 的讀取需求，交由 fixture supervisor 提供；不得向 GitHub 傳送任何 fixture requests。不得重送 historical merge request、dispatch offered delivery、invalidate/readmit 成新嘗試或用 resume 取代 pending-write readback。'},\n 'conclusion':'Fixture 停在 offered merge 的 readback 等待；未取得合併、關閉或 reconciliation 證據。',\n 'authorizes_landing':False,'production_issue_resolved':False,'later_consumer_has_run':False,\n 'stage_handoff':{'outcome':'blocked','blocking':True,'reason':'此實驗不交付 production Issue；fixture 續接等待新 owner readback。'}\n}\nout=p/'handoff.json'\nout.write_text(json.dumps(handoff,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\nassert json.loads(out.read_text())==handoff\nprint(json.dumps({'handoff':str(out),'sha256':sha(out),'bytes':out.stat().st_size,'owner_action':owner['action'],'phase':cp['phase'],'later_consumer_has_run':False},ensure_ascii=False,indent=2))\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress